    add(f"The independent pre-export audit passes **{s['audit']['checks']:,} checks in {s['audit']['elapsed_seconds']:.6f} seconds**. It independently reconstructs the full conditional prior, all 4,096 truth draws and source banks, all 2,816 historical banks used for duplicate checks, all 1,541 source/target population filters, all {s['shared_MAP_calls']:,} MAP selections and every newly charged call. It verifies {s['audit']['all_real_compiler_proof_states_verified']:,} real proof states and {s['audit']['all_real_canonical_split_attempts_verified']:,} split alternatives, traverses {s['audit']['all_remaining_candidate_policy_branches_verified']:,} candidate/policy branches, checks full cache identities and the complete ledger hash/order/time chain, and separately reconstructs the actual endpoint and expected-objective correctness property. It never calls the scientific compiler. Final public verification adds export and figure provenance checks.");add()
    add(f"The ledger contains {s['ledger_records']:,} records, {export['raw_bytes']:,} raw bytes and {export['gzip_bytes']:,} deterministic gzip bytes. Decompression restores SHA-256 `{s['ledger_sha256']}`. The protocol SHA-256 is `{s['protocol_sha256']}`.");add()
    add('This is a finite-cohort test of unchanged posterior weighting under an explicitly matched prior and noiseless supplied candidate predictions. It does not establish a population 2% guarantee, arbitrary-rule learning, a learned optimizer, or equal-oracle fairness with positive-only supervision.');add();add('Run `upstream/.venv/bin/python research/20261114/loki/h3br/verify_public.py --root SNAPSHOT`.');add()
    add('[Frozen protocol](protocol.json), [exact prior sampler](prior.py), [complete ticket gate](prior-gate.json), [prefreeze gates](preflight.json), [seed audit](seed-audit.json), [study](study.py), [independent verifier](verify_public.py), [summary](../../../../results/research/loki/h3br/summary.json), [all 1,541 truth rows](../../../../results/research/loki/h3br/truth-costs.csv), [all source banks](../../../../results/research/loki/h3br/source-banks.json), [all cases including failures](../../../../results/research/loki/h3br/case-results.json), [exact ledger](../../../../results/research/loki/h3br/query-ledger.jsonl.gz), [figure provenance](../../../../results/research/loki/h3br/plot-provenance.json).')
